{
 "comment": "Plugin-panel pattern. The G-Force has no preset SysEx: only the CC controls send anything -- LIVE (main vol, bypass, tempo tap, tuner), BLOCK BYPASS (the 9 front-panel block keys, and the unit reports their state back at every preset change), and EXT 1-8 (drive whatever the current preset's Modifier Matrix links them to). Everything else (gate, routing grid 8x4 one row at a time (shared row select over two groups), the eight blocks behind one shared select drawn once in BLOCK with generic P1..P16 slots -- names/ranges in gforce.json algorithms[block][algo].slots --, modifiers, matrix links) documents the preset for offline editing/reference and stays inert on the wire (param.path = 'none').",
